  "body": "## Summary\n\n- Collapse interior Clipper lattice micro-steps (`< 5e-5` mm) in `ring_fill::clean_walk` before `share_ends` so segment tangents stay stable on rings and `WALL` loops.\n- Extend `ring_fill` with recursive binary sub-levels up to `RING = 16` (`split_band`), `merge_flank_hits` checks in both Inside and Outside order (`level_flanks::full_width_flanks`), dual reach (`tool_r` for ring gaps, `2.0 * tool_r` where flanks fire), and `tail_extension` (`<= 3.5 * tool_r`) to `c`'s boundary.\n- Reject boundary `edge_route` chords in `level_order` and `ring_links` (`chord_full_width`) when both `0.9 * r` flanks cut unmachined stock, and walk the full multi-vertex `via` path in `level_order::join`.\n- Record design choices in `docs/decisions/3788-ring-merge-waist.md` (clean-room implementation from Held 1991 and existing flanks and keep-down laws).\n\n## Readings (Before -> After)\n\n- `fig8 Outside` (`offset_pass_start`):\n  - Before (`baad348f1`): 15 full-width points across 3 Z-levels.\n  - After: 0 full-width points; 0 narrow notes; 3 lifts (named); 0 crossings.\n- `fig8 Inside` (`offset_pass_start`):\n  - Before (`baad348f1`): 10530 wall points; 0 off-wall points; 1 narrow hit at `(35.8393, 159.0963)`.\n  - After: 10293 wall points; 0 off-wall full-width points; 0 narrow notes; 0 lifts; 0 crossings.\n- `two_lobe_waist` (`one_ring_set::two_lobe_ring_merge_cuts_no_full_width_at_waist`):\n  - Before: Outside had 70 off-wall full-width points and 5 narrow notes.\n  - After: 0 off-wall full-width points and 0 narrow notes for Outside and Inside.\n\n## Pinning Tests Verified\n\n- `cargo clippy -j 6 -p camcraft-motion --all-targets -- -D warnings` (passed)\n- `cargo clippy -j 6 -p camcraft-app --test offset_pass_start -- -D warnings` (passed)\n- `cargo test -j 6 -p camcraft-motion --lib machining2d` (`292 passed; 0 failed; 22 ignored`, including `machining2d::ring_fill::tests::a_band_with_a_ring_gap_gets_a_fill_and_a_whole_band_none`)\n- `cargo test -j 6 -p camcraft-motion --test pass_start_levels --test pass_start_engagement --test pocket3d_pass_start` (`pass_start_engagement`: 8 passed; `pass_start_levels`: 20 passed, including `one_ring_set::two_lobe_ring_merge_cuts_no_full_width_at_waist`; `pocket3d_pass_start`: 4 passed)\n- `cargo test --release -j 6 -p camcraft-app --test offset_pass_start --test flute_reach -- --include-ignored --nocapture` (`flute_reach`: 4 passed; `offset_pass_start`: 21 passed, including `fig8_outside_offset_cuts_no_move_at_full_width`, `fig8_inside_offset_names_each_full_width_cut`, `fig8_start_sides_have_no_crossing`, `lifts::fig8_start_sides_lift_only_with_a_named_reason`, `lifts::fig8_outside_pass_links_keep_off_the_part_and_enter_on_cut_floor`)\n\n## Not Exercised\n\nVerification ran in software/tests, not on a mill.\nFull `xtask gate quick` and `xtask gate light` remain for the independent gate runner.\n\nfork synced at v0.26.0\nChangelog: Fix full-width cuts where offset rings of two lobes merge (#3788)\nEffort: max\nFixes #3788",
